                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">"Introduction to Nursing" is an introductory course that guides students into the field of nursing. It helps students clarify the basic theories and framework of nursing, understand the development trends of nursing, and is an important professional foundation course. Through the course study, students can understand the nursing profession and the nursing specialty. The introduction part of the course introduces the development history of nursing, the concept and knowledge system of nursing, the nursing profession, the role and qualities of nurses; the various sections introduce the application of the nursing process to meet the needs of service recipients, the current basic theoretical system and model of nursing, as well as the application of theories from other related disciplines in nursing practice, interpersonal relationships and communication methods in nursing work, etc.</span></p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
